;
(xi)
the classification, the method of appointment and determination of the terms and conditions of service of teachers and
other persons employed in the University;
[(xi-a) the powers to be exercised and the duties to be performed by the teachers and other persons employed in the
University;]
[Inserted by Tamil Nadu Act 21 of 1986.]
